      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "I'm passionate about my work\nand disciplined towards\naccomplishing my goals. This\nhas been like this since I was\n17 and started making my way\nthrough life. Since then, Ive\nbeen gaining experience in\ndiverse environments,\nconstantly shifting towards\nmy goal of fully transitioning\ninto my dreamed software\ndevelopment career.",
