      "originalText": "I'm passionate about my work and disciplined towards accomplishing my goals. This has been like this since I was 17 and started making my way through life. Since then, Ive been gaining experience in diverse environments, constantly shifting towards my goal of fully transitioning into my dreamed software development career.",
