      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1768202127351,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "As a Full Stack Developer, I deliver end-to-end digital solutions by aligning\nbusiness requirements with robust technical execution. I specialize in building\nscalable web applications using TypeScript, React.js, and Laravel, ensuring high\nperformance through optimized database design and RESTful API integration.\nThis role has allowed me to master the application of SOLID principles and\nOOP patterns, producing clean and maintainable code for diverse client needs.",
      "fontSize": 7.885198835223532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
